WEBVTT

00:04.590 --> 00:06.020
What could that be?

00:07.030 --> 00:10.470
Lawren? Are you there?

00:11.960 --> 00:13.280
Lawren?

00:15.560 --> 00:16.530
Is that...

00:16.840 --> 00:19.790
Oh, good morning, Lady Sai—

00:20.490 --> 00:22.490
Now, that's just mean, isn't it?

00:22.490 --> 00:26.250
I've been pounding on the
door all night, you know?

00:26.250 --> 00:28.080
Wait. Huh?

00:30.120 --> 00:31.760
I said I'm sorry.

00:31.760 --> 00:34.360
Lawren, who is this gentleman?

00:34.360 --> 00:36.000
My apologies.

00:36.000 --> 00:38.770
I know him from my time at seminary.

00:38.770 --> 00:41.290
My name's Abel!

02:12.230 --> 02:15.990
Episode 2

02:12.230 --> 02:15.990
The Things They Protect

02:16.760 --> 02:18.870
Honestly...

02:18.870 --> 02:20.960
You could at least let us know 
in advance when you're coming.

02:20.960 --> 02:23.400
But we're such old friends, 
we don't need that, right?

02:23.400 --> 02:25.570
You really haven't changed at all, have you?

02:25.570 --> 02:27.360
I could say the same of you.

02:27.360 --> 02:28.520
<i>Jealous.</i>

02:27.450 --> 02:28.910
Jealous...

02:29.100 --> 02:32.080
So that's the lady saint, right?

02:32.080 --> 02:34.550
How do you know about the lady saint?

02:35.420 --> 02:37.300
I see, I see.

02:37.300 --> 02:38.120
You're too close!

02:38.120 --> 02:39.040
Ow!

02:39.300 --> 02:42.160
Don't do anything 
that frightens the lady saint.

02:42.160 --> 02:44.200
So, why are you here?

02:44.200 --> 02:45.220
The truth is,

02:45.220 --> 02:49.360
I thought I'd work here 
at your church for a little while!

02:51.530 --> 02:52.340
Huh?

02:52.680 --> 02:54.110
Lawren,

02:54.110 --> 02:58.200
even I can tell that there's 
more going on here,

02:58.200 --> 03:03.080
but neglecting a friend 
like this is just so...

03:07.800 --> 03:11.240
What made you think of working 
here in the first place?

03:11.240 --> 03:14.660
You were affiliated with a church 
in a much larger town, weren't you?

03:15.450 --> 03:16.430
Did you get fired?

03:16.430 --> 03:19.000
Please don't say such distressing things.

03:19.250 --> 03:22.960
I was tired of dealing with all the people.

03:22.960 --> 03:24.560
Lawren!

03:24.930 --> 03:27.810
Just for a little while, all right?

03:28.220 --> 03:30.990
All right! Then, I'll go fetch my luggage.

03:33.190 --> 03:35.260
I'm so sorry, Lady Saint.

03:35.260 --> 03:37.990
Not at all. It must be very difficult.

03:37.990 --> 03:39.580
Yes.

03:39.580 --> 03:43.370
Otherwise, I'm gonna have to 
give him a good talking to.

03:43.970 --> 03:45.010
<i>"I'm gonna"?</i>

03:46.170 --> 03:47.370
<i>"I'm gonna"?</i>

03:47.680 --> 03:50.250
<i>He said, "I'm gonna"!</i>

03:52.750 --> 03:54.250
Hey, Lawrence?

03:54.250 --> 03:56.960
What's the lady saint's name?

03:56.960 --> 03:59.250
Huh? Um, it's...

04:04.420 --> 04:05.200
Here.

04:05.200 --> 04:06.960
Why'd you write it down?

04:07.560 --> 04:08.750
Lady Saint!

04:08.750 --> 04:12.070
May I call you Saint Cecilia 
to show that we're friends?

04:14.680 --> 04:16.140
What's wrong?

04:16.140 --> 04:19.930
No one has called me
by my name before, so...

04:19.930 --> 04:20.760
What?

04:21.260 --> 04:22.150
Huh?

04:22.150 --> 04:23.660
What?

04:23.660 --> 04:27.470
She has such a beautiful name 
and you've never called her by it?

04:27.470 --> 04:28.930
Are you stupid?

04:29.280 --> 04:34.440
When I asked him to tell me the lady 
saint's name, he wrote it down!

04:35.160 --> 04:37.890
Abel, I assume you want to 
skip the next three meals.

04:37.890 --> 04:39.370
I'm sorry.

04:41.270 --> 04:45.920
I have some paperwork to do, 
so could you wait just a little while?

04:45.920 --> 04:47.160
Of course!

04:45.920 --> 04:47.160
Will do!

04:50.610 --> 04:52.840
Um, Mister Abel?

04:52.840 --> 04:54.300
Just Abel is fine.

04:54.840 --> 04:59.030
I heard that you've known 
Lawren since seminary.

04:59.030 --> 05:00.440
Sure have.

05:00.750 --> 05:06.610
Um, does Lawren have a s-sweetheart?

05:07.840 --> 05:08.960
He does.

05:14.030 --> 05:17.780
The scriptures have always been like 
a sweetheart to him, you see?

05:17.780 --> 05:19.210
The scriptures?

05:19.210 --> 05:20.040
Yes.

05:21.890 --> 05:24.180
Abel, you're the type 
to play mean tricks, aren't you?

05:24.180 --> 05:26.590
Then I'll give you this as an apology.

05:26.590 --> 05:27.890
What is it?

05:27.890 --> 05:31.220
The paper that Lawrence wrote your 
name on earlier, Saint Cecilia.

05:31.220 --> 05:32.680
I humbly accept!

05:32.990 --> 05:36.040
<i>Perhaps he isn't such a bad person after all.</i>

05:36.040 --> 05:38.640
People must tell you
you're a softie all the time.

05:38.960 --> 05:40.650
Sorry to keep you waiting.

05:40.900 --> 05:43.310
Well, shall we head to the church?

05:44.190 --> 05:46.150
Just a moment, please, Lawren!

05:52.410 --> 05:54.480
There. Now you're all right.

05:54.480 --> 05:56.170
Thank you.

05:58.850 --> 06:01.880
Oh, right. It's a new moon today.

06:01.880 --> 06:02.670
Huh?

06:02.940 --> 06:05.000
It's nothing. Never mind.

06:06.160 --> 06:08.280
<i>Now that I think about it, back at seminary,</i>

06:08.280 --> 06:12.450
<i>Able often came to see 
me during the new moon.</i>

06:15.000 --> 06:17.680
This really brings back memories!

06:17.680 --> 06:20.850
Then you've been here before, Abel?

06:20.850 --> 06:21.680
Yes.

06:21.680 --> 06:23.950
It was far from the seminary dorms,

06:23.950 --> 06:26.230
so he would come 
and then spend the night here.

06:26.230 --> 06:29.040
Things were so lively. We got
scolded all the time, didn't we?

06:29.040 --> 06:31.860
That's because you had far too much energy.

06:31.860 --> 06:33.200
<i>Jealous.</i>

06:32.030 --> 06:34.870
Jealous...

06:33.220 --> 06:34.870
You're so easy to read.

06:35.070 --> 06:38.870
Everything looks 
a little dusty. I should clean.

06:38.870 --> 06:44.080
You're this easy to read,
but he still hasn't noticed?

06:44.080 --> 06:48.390
I believe he thinks himself to be 
in a motherly sort of position.

06:48.390 --> 06:52.230
Not noticing things is one of 
his more unfortunate traits.

06:52.230 --> 06:55.620
You're even doing so much to help him.

06:56.260 --> 06:57.540
Abel?

06:57.540 --> 07:01.840
Well, then! I think 
I'll go take a little walk.

07:02.760 --> 07:06.450
Lady Saint, you're welcome 
to laze around as you usually do.

07:06.450 --> 07:09.480
Lawren! That's a secret!

07:09.480 --> 07:11.660
There's no need to fret so much.

07:11.660 --> 07:15.880
Then, Lady Saint, will you be 
refraining from lazing around?

07:16.650 --> 07:20.360
That will be difficult. 
I do want to loll around.

07:20.360 --> 07:21.960
You're very honest, aren't you?

07:21.960 --> 07:23.960
What a dilemma.

07:23.960 --> 07:26.190
What should I do?

07:26.190 --> 07:28.180
After all, I can't tell lies.

07:28.440 --> 07:30.430
There's no way around it.

07:30.430 --> 07:33.360
For now, you'll just have to aim for
times when Abel isn't around.

07:33.360 --> 07:34.840
I suppose so.

07:35.060 --> 07:39.800
But it's unusual for you to be so concerned 
about how someone else sees you.

07:40.280 --> 07:42.820
You don't concern yourself at 
all when it comes to me.

07:45.180 --> 07:47.060
Wh-What are you doing?

07:47.630 --> 07:52.320
The reason I can laze around without 
concerning myself with how you see me...

07:52.660 --> 07:55.900
is that you accept me that way, Lawren.

07:57.050 --> 08:00.840
I wouldn't say that I am wary of others.

08:01.110 --> 08:04.800
You're just special.

08:04.800 --> 08:07.800
Well, we have been living
together for a while now.

08:07.800 --> 08:09.800
Yes, that's true.

08:09.800 --> 08:12.090
But I do feel a little better.

08:12.090 --> 08:13.050
What?

08:13.050 --> 08:15.190
While he may be my friend,

08:15.190 --> 08:18.380
if you lazed around in front 
of someone you'd only just met,

08:18.380 --> 08:21.230
then there would be fewer 
aspects of you that only I know,

08:21.230 --> 08:22.900
and that would make me sad.

08:24.480 --> 08:27.230
Oh, I need to get things ready.

08:27.230 --> 08:29.100
Excuse me, Lady Saint.

08:33.300 --> 08:37.240
<i>Lawren is so very honest that, 
in a way, he's frightening!</i>

08:37.550 --> 08:42.280
<i>He's honest and earnest and smart...</i>

08:42.280 --> 08:43.750
<i>and kind.</i>

08:44.640 --> 08:48.710
<i>He's the first person to have found me.</i>

08:59.850 --> 09:01.520
Do something to help!

09:01.520 --> 09:04.020
You were so into it, 
I thought I didn't need to.

09:06.720 --> 09:09.920
Well, shall we tidy up?

09:09.920 --> 09:12.150
Abel, if you'd take care 
of the rounds outside?

09:12.150 --> 09:13.820
I'm busy right now.

09:13.820 --> 09:14.960
Go.

09:14.960 --> 09:16.530
All right.

09:20.850 --> 09:22.610
Wh-What is it?

09:22.610 --> 09:26.480
I was just thinking that you're
a little rough with your friend.

09:27.730 --> 09:30.100
That's my grandfather's influence.

09:30.100 --> 09:32.540
He was a straightforward person.

09:34.680 --> 09:36.180
Lawren?

09:36.180 --> 09:37.680
Are you all right?

09:38.040 --> 09:40.480
I'm sorry. It's a headache.

09:40.480 --> 09:42.560
I'm going to lie down for a moment.

09:43.820 --> 09:46.560
<i>Why would he suddenly get 
a headache like this?</i>

09:47.560 --> 09:49.780
<i>I-I should call someone here!</i>

09:49.780 --> 09:52.100
I've finished the rounds!

09:52.100 --> 09:53.570
Wait, what's this?

09:53.570 --> 09:55.610
Abel! It's awful!

09:55.610 --> 09:58.950
Lawren's condition 
suddenly... What do we do?

09:58.950 --> 10:01.120
Oh, could this be...

10:01.760 --> 10:03.330
Saint Cecilia,

10:03.330 --> 10:05.360
did you bestow too much 
of your divine protection?

10:10.980 --> 10:13.120
So that's how you get rid of it.

10:16.640 --> 10:18.560
I feel better.

10:18.560 --> 10:21.180
Lawren! I'm so glad!

10:21.180 --> 10:23.060
Oh! Lawren is...!

10:23.060 --> 10:25.840
This time, I'm sure it's a physical pain.

10:26.720 --> 10:28.680
I'm sorry for not saying anything.

10:28.680 --> 10:31.770
I've always been able to 
see all sorts of things.

10:31.770 --> 10:33.930
That's why you were able to see that I'd

10:33.930 --> 10:36.750
bestowed too much divine 
protection, isn't it?

10:36.750 --> 10:40.280
No, no. That's far more than I can see.

10:40.680 --> 10:43.150
Though, I did know that it was there.

10:43.550 --> 10:45.340
Even under normal circumstances,

10:45.650 --> 10:52.160
a certain someone's protecting
him more than anyone else.

10:53.320 --> 10:54.880
Saint Cecilia,

10:54.880 --> 10:58.170
how many layers of protection 
do you have on Lawrence?

10:58.840 --> 11:02.490
More than could possibly be counted.

11:03.790 --> 11:07.110
The fact that nothing happened 
to Lawren before we met,

11:07.110 --> 11:09.110
that was thanks to you, wasn't it?

11:09.110 --> 11:10.950
You're blowing it out of proportion.

11:10.950 --> 11:15.570
I did what could be done 
with a novice's knowledge, that's all.

11:12.350 --> 11:16.460
There, there, there, there, 
there, there, there, there...

11:16.460 --> 11:20.400
And through all of that, days like today 
with a new moon were particularly...

11:21.230 --> 11:26.360
Bad things are more easily
 attracted on nights with no moonlight.

11:26.360 --> 11:30.240
Though, things that are the exact 
opposite of those are attracted to him, too.

11:30.540 --> 11:32.740
Both angels and demons...

11:32.740 --> 11:35.230
It seems guys like this are their type.

11:36.960 --> 11:40.010
That note

11:40.280 --> 11:42.080
Are you listening?

11:41.050 --> 11:44.010
First look at this side of Lawrence.

11:42.080 --> 11:43.130
Sorry.

11:49.010 --> 11:53.380
I tripped up here again! Are you serious?

11:54.330 --> 11:59.100
It's because that's the one place 
where you can't read ahead in the music.

11:57.570 --> 11:59.650
"A New Saint Has Been Discovered"

11:59.660 --> 12:05.080
Grandpa, is the fact that a new lady saint 
has been discovered a big deal?

12:05.080 --> 12:06.650
Well, yes, it is.

12:06.960 --> 12:11.040
Because there is now one more 
of the lady saints that so many seek out.

12:11.040 --> 12:13.790
Of course everyone is happy about it.

12:15.620 --> 12:20.000
This village doesn't have 
a lady saint's divine protection yet.

12:20.230 --> 12:21.240
Divine protection?

12:21.560 --> 12:25.140
Saints protect the people. {ep1 00:01}

12:25.140 --> 12:28.190
She protects them, whether it be 
from the weakness in their heart

12:28.190 --> 12:29.920
or from outside evils.

12:29.920 --> 12:33.220
And there are stories about them 
protecting others from natural disasters.

12:33.220 --> 12:36.040
From disasters? But how?

12:36.040 --> 12:37.610
No idea.

12:37.610 --> 12:40.610
The lady saints have the will 
to protect the rest of us.

12:40.610 --> 12:46.570
And the miracles they bring about are 
sometimes called their divine protection.

12:46.570 --> 12:52.320
And it is only because we protect them 
that they are able to continue to protect us.

12:52.560 --> 12:54.200
Do you understand, Lawrence?

12:55.030 --> 13:00.590
Should you ever meet a saint, 
you mustn't forget that.

13:00.590 --> 13:04.570
After all, you're a bit 
different from the rest.

13:07.160 --> 13:10.150
Angels and demons, like fairies,

13:10.150 --> 13:13.520
can't be seen with the eye. 
He's predisposed to attract all of them.

13:13.780 --> 13:17.260
And the fact that he's completely 
unaware of it is the biggest problem.

13:17.260 --> 13:22.770
Attracting things he can't 
see only taxes Lawren.

13:22.770 --> 13:27.870
If only he could see them, then there 
would be ways to guard against them.

13:27.870 --> 13:32.910
And if anyone from the village asks for
him, he goes out, even at night.

13:33.200 --> 13:36.670
Even if I put geraniums 
in Lawren's room to keep evil at bay...

13:36.830 --> 13:37.930
They're so pretty.

13:37.930 --> 13:40.410
I'll leave them somewhere that 
the lady saint can see them as well.

13:40.800 --> 13:44.000
And so, the geraniums 
have ended up over there.

13:46.760 --> 13:48.780
Since he has you 
protecting him, Saint Cecilia,

13:48.780 --> 13:50.380
there's no need to worry, is there?

13:50.380 --> 13:52.730
That isn't true at all.

13:52.730 --> 13:56.930
The more things protecting Lawren, 
the more reassured I feel.

13:56.930 --> 14:00.460
Saint Cecilia, even given 
that this place is your holy sanctuary,

14:00.460 --> 14:03.370
you've added your divine protection 
on top of that, haven't you?

14:04.300 --> 14:06.820
I've heard that bestowing too much of

14:06.820 --> 14:10.650
that sort of power on someone 
could be harmful, but...

14:10.650 --> 14:12.780
I'm so sorry!

14:12.780 --> 14:14.160
<i>She's kneeling?</i>

14:14.160 --> 14:17.130
I meant to protect Lawren, 
but I caused him pain.

14:17.130 --> 14:18.810
I'm a failure as a saint!

14:18.810 --> 14:20.170
There, there.

14:20.170 --> 14:23.560
If I only had more power to begin with,

14:23.560 --> 14:26.880
I'd be able to extend the safe area further.

14:26.880 --> 14:29.610
I wish I could make the entirety of the area

14:29.610 --> 14:31.980
where Lawren travels my holy ground.

14:31.640 --> 14:33.890
The whole village

14:31.980 --> 14:33.900
<i>How overprotective.</i>

14:33.900 --> 14:37.900
<i>He's overprotective, too, but
it looks like they're evenly matched.</i>

14:38.640 --> 14:41.920
You haven't discussed any of this 
with Lawrence, have you?

14:41.920 --> 14:42.940
No.

14:42.940 --> 14:47.160
After all, realizing that you 
are unique is a scary thing.

14:47.160 --> 14:50.200
Well, I haven't talked to him 
about it either, so I don't blame you.

14:50.500 --> 14:53.600
Now that I think about it, there's 
something in the church, too, isn't there?

14:53.600 --> 14:54.460
Yes.

14:54.460 --> 14:58.280
There are four angels and lots of fairies.

14:58.280 --> 15:01.270
If they attach themselves to him, 
his health will fail again, won't it?

15:01.270 --> 15:02.280
Yes.

15:02.280 --> 15:06.080
The angels are pulled toward Lawren,

15:05.960 --> 15:10.300
No fair.




No fair.

15:06.080 --> 15:08.680
so I'm often competing with them for him.

15:08.680 --> 15:10.300
<i>Now there's a bloody battle for you.</i>

15:10.300 --> 15:13.490
So, the reason that you came to visit was to

15:13.490 --> 15:16.320
make sure that Lawren 
was all right, wasn't it?

15:16.320 --> 15:17.720
That's right.

15:17.720 --> 15:22.160
He hadn't written about his health 
in his letters, so I wondered how he was.

15:22.160 --> 15:23.830
Was there anything about me?

15:23.830 --> 15:25.350
He didn't write about you.

15:25.350 --> 15:26.150
What?

15:26.150 --> 15:29.190
To be precise, he did write 
about someone he was living with.

15:29.190 --> 15:31.300
He wrote about how they 
wouldn't wake up in the morning,

15:31.300 --> 15:34.260
and that they lolled around, 
making him do all sorts of things.

15:34.260 --> 15:35.920
Lawren!

15:36.840 --> 15:38.320
Oh, but...

15:39.280 --> 15:44.320
he did say that every day was a different 
color because of them, so it was fun.

15:46.930 --> 15:50.240
Because he wrote things like that, 
I wasn't too worried,

15:50.240 --> 15:52.630
and it looks like whatever 
worries I had were needless anyway.

15:52.630 --> 15:54.630
Instead of an idiot like me,

15:54.630 --> 15:57.340
he has you, the Lady 
Saint Cecilia, with him.

15:57.340 --> 15:59.720
Lawrence will be perfectly safe.

15:59.720 --> 16:02.060
You mustn't say such things.

16:02.950 --> 16:04.500
Saint Cecilia?

16:04.770 --> 16:10.190
Lawren's nature is unusual, 
so it's difficult to handle properly.

16:10.190 --> 16:14.980
And yet, for a normal person to have been 
able to succeed in such a thing...

16:14.980 --> 16:18.700
Much effort and talent would 
have been required of them.

16:19.130 --> 16:23.720
If you hadn't been there for him, 
Lawren wouldn't be here now.

16:25.010 --> 16:28.630
Abel, you are an incredible person.

16:30.440 --> 16:34.640
Even if you are outrageous, 
your behavior makes no sense,

16:34.640 --> 16:37.320
and you quickly grow arrogant... even then.

16:37.320 --> 16:40.810
It sounds like it could be a compliment, 
but you're just knocking me down, aren't you?

16:40.800 --> 16:42.440
That isn't my intent at all!

16:42.440 --> 16:46.300
I wasn't speaking ill of you! 
I was only saying what I think! Wait...

16:44.330 --> 16:48.510
Saint Cecilia truly is a lady saint.

16:48.920 --> 16:51.560
In any case, it just isn't fair, Abel!

16:51.560 --> 16:54.530
I want to see Lawren 
in his seminary days, too!

16:54.530 --> 16:56.790
I do have a few pictures.

16:56.790 --> 16:58.330
I'll bring them next time.

16:58.330 --> 17:01.080
Yes, you must!

17:01.400 --> 17:06.590
<i>Looking at her like this, 
she's just a girl in love with Lawrence.</i>

17:09.750 --> 17:12.590
Saint Cecilia, can you cook?

17:12.590 --> 17:13.800
No.

17:19.800 --> 17:22.320
Lady Saint? Abel?

17:25.710 --> 17:28.950
We thought we'd try to cook 
something in your stead, Lawren.

17:28.950 --> 17:30.480
You, Lady Saint?

17:30.710 --> 17:35.320
I learned once again how 
important your presence is to me.

17:35.920 --> 17:37.060
Here you go.

17:37.690 --> 17:40.030
Abel!

17:40.030 --> 17:43.690
Th-This is, um... I-It 
isn't even pretty to look at!

17:43.690 --> 17:46.040
Everyone's first try is like this.

17:46.580 --> 17:48.300
I accept it with gratitude.

17:57.420 --> 17:59.860
What's this? It's delicious!

17:59.860 --> 18:02.020
I-Is it really?

18:09.760 --> 18:11.600
That's dangerous, Abel!

18:11.600 --> 18:13.520
Lady Saint, are you all right?

18:15.510 --> 18:18.030
I-I'm quite all right.

18:18.030 --> 18:20.280
Let me see, just in case!

18:20.280 --> 18:22.410
I-I'm all right!

18:22.410 --> 18:24.790
What if your lip is cut?

18:24.790 --> 18:26.860
I-It isn't cut!

18:26.860 --> 18:29.880
I'm telling you, it isn't cut!

18:27.190 --> 18:29.880
<i>He seems to be torturing Saint Cecilia.</i>

18:29.880 --> 18:32.320
I-I'm going to go change my clothes!

18:34.480 --> 18:36.240
Now then, Abel.

18:37.010 --> 18:40.130
Why did you really come here?

18:41.030 --> 18:44.380
So you're wary of me, huh?

18:44.380 --> 18:46.100
Don't worry.

18:46.100 --> 18:50.140
I'm not going to go telling any 
wicked nobles about Saint Cecilia.

18:50.490 --> 18:52.960
And I'm not planning anything 
rash like exposing her.

18:52.960 --> 18:55.400
After all, the lady saint's influence

18:55.400 --> 18:57.400
is much greater than we think, right?

18:58.920 --> 19:01.660
You're right. Sorry.

19:01.970 --> 19:04.360
Maybe it's because my 
headache was so bad today,

19:04.360 --> 19:06.200
I can't really relax for some reason.

19:06.750 --> 19:08.340
Hey, Abel?

19:08.340 --> 19:10.230
On days like today when I feel poorly,

19:10.230 --> 19:13.910
if the lady saint stays with me, 
I recover quickly.

19:13.910 --> 19:16.080
When I think about it,

19:16.440 --> 19:20.220
it feels like the same thing happened 
when I spent time with you at seminary.

19:20.220 --> 19:23.120
Are you connected to the lady saint somehow?

19:23.490 --> 19:25.550
No, it's just coincidence, don't you think?

19:25.550 --> 19:27.460
Is it?

19:27.460 --> 19:30.220
I'd feel badly if I was making 
the two of you do things for me.

19:30.690 --> 19:34.160
<i>So his own health doesn't come first?</i>

19:34.160 --> 19:38.040
It's not possible for me to have 
the power to protect people, is it?

19:38.040 --> 19:39.890
And here's a more important question.

19:39.890 --> 19:42.390
What do you think of Saint Cecilia?

19:42.390 --> 19:43.360
What?

19:43.360 --> 19:46.830
Well... I respect her.

19:46.830 --> 19:48.560
She's not a morning person.

19:48.560 --> 19:51.220
When no one's looking, she lazes around.

19:51.220 --> 19:54.710
Her mood frequently goes back 
and forth from good to bad.

19:54.710 --> 19:58.120
But there's a part of her 
that tries really hard, like she did today.

19:58.120 --> 20:00.880
She's a kind person who works 
for the sake of others.

20:00.880 --> 20:03.080
I respect and trust her.

20:03.080 --> 20:04.470
That's only natural, isn't it?

20:06.480 --> 20:07.980
I see.

20:10.230 --> 20:11.380
Lawren?

20:11.380 --> 20:12.990
Is something wrong?

20:12.990 --> 20:15.720
There's an eight-legged visitor in my room.

20:15.720 --> 20:18.900
A spider? I'll go chase it out.

20:18.900 --> 20:22.240
And in that time, Abel, 
you clean up the kitchen.

20:22.240 --> 20:23.320
What?

20:23.320 --> 20:27.880
Let's hurry, Lawren! 
If we don't, it might hide!

20:27.880 --> 20:31.680
<i>Holding up the word "respect" 
next to the lady herself,</i>

20:31.680 --> 20:33.910
<i>it feels like the word is lacking.</i>

20:34.230 --> 20:36.340
<i>I mean, I do respect her,</i>

20:36.660 --> 20:39.280
<i>but it doesn't really capture everything.</i>

20:40.030 --> 20:41.840
<i>Ever since I met her...</i>

20:47.000 --> 20:49.670
<i>she's always been a lady saint, you see?</i>

20:51.400 --> 20:53.600
L-Lawren!

20:53.600 --> 20:55.800
I found him! This is him!

20:55.800 --> 20:58.360
Oh, yes. I'll chase him out.

21:00.150 --> 21:02.300
There, it's all right now.

21:02.790 --> 21:06.280
Thank you... for this and cooking for me.

21:06.760 --> 21:08.530
It seems that I...

21:09.380 --> 21:12.880
simply can't live without you, Lawren.

21:18.840 --> 21:23.040
<i>When she puts it like that, 
it sounds like she needs me.</i>

21:23.640 --> 21:27.070
<i>But thanks to the lady saint, every day I...</i>

21:28.400 --> 21:33.800
It is only because we protect them 
that they are able to continue to protect us.

21:34.310 --> 21:37.420
So, you make these sorts 
of mistakes, too, Lawrence?

21:37.420 --> 21:39.040
It's the same as me.

21:40.210 --> 21:44.070
<i>Grandpa, is this what you 
were trying to tell me?</i>

21:45.400 --> 21:47.950
<i>Just like that "should 
you ever" you spoke of...</i>

21:48.430 --> 21:52.500
<i>I've met a Lady Saint 
that I want to protect.</i>

23:25.860 --> 23:27.520
Tidy up.

23:29.690 --> 23:30.350
Oops.

23:32.070 --> 23:32.880
Oops.

23:36.400 --> 23:39.210
Housework really is hard, isn't it?
